../2735462-fire_bolt/result-fire_bolt.json:26:      "justification": "The spell has an on-hit secondary rider that starts a flammable object burning, but the closed spell effect vocabulary only supports damage or none.",
../2735462-fire_bolt/result-fire_bolt.json:27:      "evidence": "A flammable object hit by this spell starts burning if it isn't being worn or carried."
../2735462-fire_bolt/result-fire_bolt.json:31:  "notes": "Encoded honestly as a one-phase activation for the ranged spell attack and tier-scaled fire damage. The object-ignition rider is preserved in description text but omitted from mechanics because the surface/tracer lacks an ignition or burning effect."
